            <title><![CDATA[Zelenskyy seeks to mend ties with Trump ahead of Witkoff-Putin meeting]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/zelenskyy-seeks-to-mend-ties-with-trump-ahead-of-witkoff-putin-meeting</link>
            <description><![CDATA[Ukrainian President Zelenskyy met with U.S. envoy Steve Witkoff and European officials in Norway in a bid to avoid a further diplomatic rupture with President Trump. Over the past week, Trump has criticized Zelenskyy over Ukraine's efforts to inflict heavy losses on Russia. The meeting was aimed at easing tensions ahead of Witkoff's meeting with Vladimir Putin in Russia. Nick Schifrin reports.]]></description>
