            <title><![CDATA[News Wrap: Britain sending air support to Saudi Arabia amid Houthi attacks]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/news-wrap-britain-sending-air-support-to-saudi-arabia-amid-houthi-attacks</link>
            <description><![CDATA[In our news wrap Tuesday, British authorities say they're sending air support to Saudi Arabia to protect against missiles and drones launched by Iran-backed Houthi rebels in Yemen, Vice President Vance says he's not endorsing Benjamin Netanyahu ahead of Israeli elections and voters in Alberta overwhelmingly rejected a referendum that would have put the province on a path toward independence.]]></description>
